Snaking across valleys, tunneling through mountains, towering over cities, the world's

10
00:00:52,781 --> 00:00:57,780
world's superhighways dominate the Earth's landscape.

11
00:00:57,781 --> 00:01:01,280
Superhighways are the greatest single structures in the world.

12
00:01:01,281 --> 00:01:02,780
They are enormously wide.

