00:16:47,961 --> 00:16:52,960
300,000 commuters pass through this Cloverleaf interchange each day.

204
00:16:52,961 --> 00:16:58,960
The dense volume of traffic has exposed a key design weakness common to this configuration.

205
00:16:58,961 --> 00:17:05,960
On a Cloverleaf, you have two patterns of traffic emerging in the same space.

206
00:17:05,961 --> 00:17:18,120
One flow of traffic is trying to emerge onto the freeway, and in the same section of roadway, another stream of traffic is trying to emerge off the freeway.

207
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:31,233
Since the initial construction of America's first major highways decades ago, increased traffic volume has forced the hand of state engineers to design more elaborate

208
00:17:31,234 --> 00:17:31,940
